sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Workspace Administrator Console
    participant Gateway as Centralized Access Gateway
    participant Policy as Organization Policy Evaluation Service
    participant Store as Project Configuration and Audit Store

    Note over Admin: The operator must complete elevated authentication before changing organization-wide defaults
    Admin->>Gateway: Submit configuration update request with rollout scope and enforcement mode
    Note over Gateway,Store: All configuration writes must preserve an immutable audit trail and a rollback snapshot
    Gateway->>Policy: Validate change set against policy constraints and environment restrictions
    Policy-->>Gateway: Return approved policy result and required audit attributes
    Gateway->>Store: Persist configuration update, rollback snapshot, and operator attribution metadata
    Store-->>Gateway: Return persisted version id and rollback reference
    Gateway-->>Admin: Confirm configuration update and expose rollback identifier
